13,"y":526,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"문장이","x":1174,"y":522,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"포함된다.","x":1264,"y":523,"width":114,"height":29},{"text":"트랜잭션은","x":1392,"y":521,"width":145,"height":30}]},{"text":"분할할 수 없는 최소의 단위다. 그러므로 전부 적용하거나 전부 취소한다. 즉 TRANSACHON은 ALL OR","words":[{"text":"분할할","x":204,"y":574,"width":82,"height":28},{"text":"수","x":301,"y":574,"width":27,"height":28},{"text":"없는","x":345,"y":573,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"최소의","x":412,"y":573,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"단위다.","x":504,"y":573,"width":82,"height":28},{"text":"그러므로","x":604,"y":574,"width":100,"height":28},{"text":"전부","x":721,"y":573,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"적용하거나","x":787,"y":572,"width":124,"height":30},{"text":"전부","x":926,"y":571,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"취소한다.","x":991,"y":570,"width":108,"height":29},{"text":"즉","x":1117,"y":572,"width":27,"height":28},{"text":"TRANSACHON은","x":1158,"y":571,"width":237,"height":27},{"text":"ALL","x":1412,"y":572,"width":59,"height":24},{"text":"OR","x":1490,"y":570,"width":46,"height":25}]},{"text":"NOTHING의 개념이다.","words":[{"text":"NOTHING의","x":204,"y":619,"width":161,"height":29},{"text":"개념이다.","x":381,"y":619,"width":107,"height":29}]},{"text":"은행에서의 계좌이체 상황을 연상하면 트랜잭션을 이해하는 데 도움이 된다. 계조}이체는 최소한 두 가지 이상의","words":[{"text":"은행에서의","x":238,"y":666,"width":126,"height":30},{"text":"계좌이체","x":378,"y":666,"width":99,"height":29},{"text":"상황을","x":489,"y":666,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"연상하면","x":575,"y":666,"width":97,"height":30},{"text":"트랜잭션을","x":683,"y":667,"width":124,"height":29},{"text":"이해하는","x":817,"y":667,"width":98,"height":29},{"text":"데","x":925,"y":666,"width":23,"height":29},{"text":"도움이","x":959,"y":665,"width":73,"height":30},{"text":"된다.","x":1044,"y":664,"width":57,"height":30},{"text":"계조}이체는","x":1114,"y":664,"width":128,"height":31},{"text":"최소한","x":1252,"y":664,"width":81,"height":30},{"text":"두","x":1343,"y":667,"width":29,"height":27},{"text":"가지","x":1383,"y":664,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"이상의","x":1452,"y":662,"width":83,"height":30}]},{"text":"직업으로 이루어져 있다. 우선 자신의 계좌에서 진빽을 확인하고 이체할 금액을 인출한 다음 나머지 금액을 저장한다.","words":[{"text":"직업으로","x":205,"y":713,"width":102,"height":29},{"text":"이루어져","x":316,"y":713,"width":96,"height":29},{"text":"있다.","x":426,"y":713,"width":54,"height":29},{"text":"우선","x":491,"y":713,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"자신의","x":551,"y":713,"width":71,"height":29},{"text":"계좌에서","x":634,"y":713,"width":94,"height":29},{"text":"진빽을","x":739,"y":714,"width":73,"height":29},{"text":"확인하고","x":820,"y":714,"width":98,"height":30},{"text":"이체할","x":927,"y":713,"width":73,"height":29},{"text":"금액을","x":1008,"y":712,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"인출한","x":1093,"y":712,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"다음","x":1176,"y":712,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"나머지","x":1237,"y":711,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"금액을","x":1325,"y":712,"width":82,"height":29},{"text":"저장한다.","x":1418,"y":710,"width":118,"height":31}]},{"text":"그리고 이체할 계좌를 확인하고 잎에서 인출한 금액을 더한 다음에 저장하면 계좌이체가 성공한다.","words":[{"text":"그리고","x":204,"y":760,"width":80,"height":28},{"text":"이체할","x":298,"y":759,"width":77,"height":29},{"text":"계좌를","x":389,"y":760,"width":76,"height":29},{"text":"확인하고","x":478,"y":760,"width":103,"height":29},{"text":"잎에서","x":594,"y":760,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"인출한","x":682,"y":760,"width":76,"height":29},{"text":"금액을","x":770,"y":761,"width":76,"height":29},{"text":"더한","x":859,"y":761,"width":50,"height":29},{"text":"다음에","x":921,"y":760,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"저장하면","x":1011,"y":760,"width":99,"height":29},{"text":"계좌이체가","x":1125,"y":759,"width":130,"height":30},{"text":"성공한다.","x":1269,"y":759,"width":117,"height":30}]},{"text":"계최OI체 사례","words":[{"text":"계최OI체","x":240,"y":854,"width":100,"height":29},{"text":"사례","x":355,"y":854,"width":51,"height":28}]},{"text":"STEPI. 1%번 계좌의 잔액에서 10,%0원을 편다.","words":[{"text":"STEPI.","x":261,"y":904,"width":88,"height":24},{"text":"1%번","x":365,"y":901,"width":67,"heig